                    insight_anchor:         `Resistance is still high — the anchor never came on board, and ~60% of the division reads her better than your memos. Until she's converted from sceptic to advocate, adoption is fragile.`,
                    insight_disciplined:    `This is authenticity as discipline: you stayed true to yourself and consciously dialled up empathy and self-regulation. Self-awareness, not instinct, carried the change — and the trust survived contact with a hard transformation.`,

                    hint_broken:            `The 144-year promise is breaking — trust is through the floor or reskilling underfunded. Protect the promise: own the truth and fund the human side of the change before anything else.`,
